{"type": "say", "text": "Hi everyone. As we approach the production policy review on August 25, I want to make sure we're all aligned on the process. I'll be making the final decision on the rate-limit policy that gets communicated to customers, but before I do, I need each of your teams to report your release-impacting findings. To recap where the draft stands: we're looking at 100 requests per minute for ordinary API keys, the same limit applied to authentication endpoints, and no staffed launch window specified. I'd like to hear from backend engineering, customer success, security, and support operations on any concerns or findings before I record the final policy. Who wants to start?"}
```

